# Store chrome appearance (LOCKED)

**Surface:** Store Settings → Appearance · `storeChrome.ts` · `StoreChromeFields` · `BrandingPanel` · `portal-tokens.css` shell wallpaper.

## Locked behaviors
- Custom **picture wallpaper** must sample brightness (`shellWallpaperLuma`) — never hardcode `shell-luma=dark` for every photo (white titles on light sky = banned).
- Store owner **page BG + text color + title mode** (`pageBgColor` / `pageTextColor` / `shellTextMode`) persist per `store_id` in `chromeBrand`.
- `paint()` must **not** wipe owner `data-custom-text` / `data-custom-bg`.
- Appearance: **Save appearance** button — no auto-save spam; chrome media upload stays IndexedDB-first on localhost (no CORS force to mieraf).
- Empty remote MySQL must not wipe local durable wallpaper/sidebar images while chrome-idb pending.

## Do not
- Re-enable debounce auto `saveStoreChrome` on every slider tick
- Force white page titles on all custom wallpapers
- Cross-store borrow of chrome images / brand colors

## Fonts
EN/AR fonts + weights stay in BrandingPanel (global CSS vars) — extend, do not rebuild.
